# wtFrameControl([]byte{MsgHello}) -- a hello message on the WebTransport
# control stream, which carries every control message in both directions:
# init, stats, pong and event from the server; touch, key, scroll, ping and
# hello from the client. Every one of them is length-prefixed this way, a
# u32 big-endian byte count of the message that follows, capped at 1 MiB
# (wtControlLimit) -- see wtFrameControl / wtReadControlFrame and
# docs/protocol.md.
#
# bytes 0-3  length    00000001    1, big endian -- the message is one byte
# byte 4     message   15          MsgHello
00000001
15
